  A40_growth/report.md                         the claim that the action decides for total matter survives=False
      where: section 5.1, K11, branch S of the growth table, abstract
      why:   the ADJUDICATION does not survive; the NUMBER does. A40's own K11 gives sigma8(S)/sigma8(C) = 1.0019, so sigma8 = 0.7619, f(z), chi2 = 14.21/8 and every growth conclusion stand to 0.19%. The claim 'the action decides for S' falls.
