      why:   A44 converts M200 -> M_b through the cosmic budget. That identification is M_total = M_b + M_c as a DEFINITION of the cosmic share (A18), not the statement that the law's source is total. No change needed; flagged for clarity.

  scope: every other lane that uses the law (A7, A9, A11, A14, A16, A18, A20, A21, A25, A26,
